RESOLUTION NO. __________

ENTITLED: “A RESOLUTION ADOPTING THE 2025-2027 CITY OF CHEYENNE
COMPREHENSIVE CONSOLIDATED PLAN AND 2025 ANNUAL
ACTION PLAN, AS PREPARED BY THE CHEYENNE HOUSING AND
COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENT OFFICE AND SETTING THE
PUBLIC COMMENT PERIOD AND PUBLIC HEARINGS FOR THE
PLANS.”

WHEREAS, the U.S. Department of Housing and Urban Development (HUD)
allocates federal funding to local jurisdictions to address housing needs and urban
development challenges;

WHEREAS, the City of Cheyenne has been designated by HUD as an Entitlement
Community and is eligible to receive an annual allocation of Community Development Block
Grant (CDBG) funds based on submission of a Comprehensive Consolidated Plan, which plan
must be developed on three to five-year cycles;

WHEREAS, the City of Cheyenne Housing and Community Development Division
has prepared the City of Cheyenne Comprehensive Consolidated Plan 2025-2027,
incorporating the 2025 Annual Action Plan, for submission to and adoption by the Governing
Body;

WHEREAS, the City of Cheyenne Comprehensive Consolidated Plan 2025-2027 and
2025 Annual Action Plan were developed with citizen participation and provide for a thirty
(30) day public comment period, scheduled for June 9, 2025, through July 8, 2025; and

WHEREAS, a public hearing on the plans will be held during the City Council
meeting on June 23, 2025, and a public meeting is scheduled to occur during the City Council
Finance Committee meeting on July 8, 2025.

NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE
CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING, that the City of Cheyenne Comprehensive Consolidated
Plan 2025-2027, inclusive of the 2025 Annual Action Plan, is hereby adopted;

BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED that the Cheyenne Housing and Community
Development Division is authorized to submit the Plan to the Rocky Mountain, Region 8
Office of the U.S. Department of Housing and Urban Development;

BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED that the Mayor of the City of Cheyenne, in his
capacity as the certifying officer for the City for purposes of the CDBG entitlement program,
is hereby authorized to execute all documents and certifications necessary to facilitate the
receipt of allocated program funds; and

1:37 pm, Jun 03, 2025
